	<markup_html><![CDATA[<section class="ai-banner">
    <div class="ai-banner-container">
      <div class="ai-content">
        <h2>Why this is the practical AI play for software teams.</h2>
        <ul class="ai-benefits">
          <li class="ai-benefit-item">
            <i class="ph ph-rocket-launch"></i>
            <span class="ai-benefit-text"><strong>Faster build cycles:</strong> AI-assisted development compresses the tedious parts of software delivery while experienced engineers keep requirements, architecture, security, and maintainability in focus.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="ai-benefit-item">
            <i class="ph ph-coin"></i>
            <span class="ai-benefit-text"><strong>More QA coverage:</strong> AI agents can check user flows repeatedly and patiently, making them ideal for smoke tests, regression passes, and pre-release validation.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="ai-benefit-item">
            <i class="ph ph-seal-check"></i>
            <span class="ai-benefit-text"><strong>You stay in control:</strong> AI accelerates the work, but humans own the judgment calls. We keep plans, code, tests, and release decisions inspectable.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ai-visual">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 420 210" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="width:100%;height:auto;">
          <text x="210" y="22" text-anchor="middle" fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.45)" font-size="8.5" font-weight="700" letter-spacing="0.1em" font-family="Space Grotesk, sans-serif">AI WORKFLOW PIPELINE</text>

